<title>NETHERLANDS: BADMINTON-DUTCH OPEN FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-DUTCH OPEN FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DEN BOSCH, Netherlands 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the</p>
<p>singles finals in Dutch Open Badminton Championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Sun Jun (China) beat Poul-Erik Hoyer Larsen (Denmark) 5-9 9-3</p>
<p>9-3 9-5</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Yao Yan (China) beat Han Jinga (China) 9-2 9-2 9-0</p>
<p>Note - The Dutch Open is the first grand prix tournament to</p>
<p>play the best-of-five shortened games, each to nine points</p>
<p>instead of the best-of-three 15-point games</p>
</text>
